  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v7.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "761b3d657591e08b9b10868d3c9da404599eca3190760f863b1c0fb77f4b3fc9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a93a914fb420af3ed68cd7d71f9ed8b5709b23ff908a06a21d9027297ac26884",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nSlippy-Slide\nSkates",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53bffa7377d7e24c8a6e3a7f6e6f84f9c29c4ac42b126c555e8652b300d8d179",
      "text": "Wukong watched them glide.\n“Look! Flying feet!”\n“I want to try!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac9ab827cd580da48fe2916f6abab6b5d5c1c25e8f56c0e9d1b883637714b7fe",
      "text": "He put on his skates.\nClomp. Clomp.\n“My feet have tiny sleds!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7a38599601f4b04ceb47a4a3905a12afbf8a92dc99ec1a67df35eb3f2e4a2a2d",
      "text": "Helmet on. Mittens on.\nCoach Otter checked\nhis skates.\n“Ready for little steps?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1120daa2bbe2aaae08e68e0c691556db576ac9ed03b6f8843c06d1d774a48d80",
      "text": "Wukong stepped onto the ice.\nHis feet slid apart.\n“Wait for me, feet!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3b26945cf79593ceb5d933a21531105397c3ce2c7b3db50a06296501ff0a4462",
      "text": "Whoops! Wukong fell down.\nHis bottom met the ice.\n“Hello, chilly floor.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26da614242cb3d3632c7438e0e48394858b5908f128dbf04f5572b20123513dd",
      "text": "“Let’s practice,” said Coach\nOtter.\n“Let’s get up together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce8188a60f4b26afb9a64f30b0d169ff2b0158f218de188e7aefad844db8761a",
      "text": "Little steps. Bent knees.\n“Like a penguin!” said Jade.\nWukong stepped and giggled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71c218762dbafdc1ce737dbabe57236dc90f73ec0b327232f24d75f0e00c85a0",
      "text": "Push… glide.\nPush… glide.\nOne tiny slide!\nThen another.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f5f8868a3880c256f5bb15504212f245cd234c90c80b6630ad1902998318f752",
      "text": "Then came another tumble.\n“Oh! I fell down again.”\nHe sat beside Pigsy.\n“Rest with me,” said Pigsy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1cbd12ca7cdc2a3ed252cd92bdbccbcedf483dbade3ae3f75afeeb64aac4a8a4",
      "text": "They warmed their hands.\nThey watched the snow.\n“I’ll try again,” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0640b40c11cc362a1ed85161365ca3d3cd19041880f95602ac3e205185bc400f",
      "text": "He came back to practice.\nA small step. A slow glide.\nHe wobbled, but kept going.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70165b1fa1c0b7acf5af0d8afb007aaf205c9b9fc557e1f50dad707999a81739",
      "text": "Then he could glide a little.\nPush... glide.\nPush... glide.\n“Look! I’m doing it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a26589e5f8e29fe3289f808afe0c15af82aabbac84359bb5cf8d9ad14b79e020",
      "text": "They made a gentle circle.\nJade led. Pigsy followed.\nWukong glided along.\nSix happy skates!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9fc978079b7100be95d316510bb26319a279fceff4e911cdd847e71ff1493cda",
      "text": "The rink lights twinkled.\n“See you soon, ice!”\nHis feet were tired.\nHis smile was not.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b5ecea7e8c17fd4e6e69f74c6116577dec7c042ef6b5c50ac31776978b9fc331",
      "text": "Wukong pulled up his blanket.\nHe dreamed of gliding past\nstars.\nSlowly. Softly.\nOff to sleep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
